I think wombats should play it because it's weightless AC. Nothing else
in the game improves your armor class without adding weight. And as we
all well know weight management is a critical aspect of the game.

Naked AC1 lets you shed some of that weighty armor.

It's the same reason virtually all nethack characters aspire to some
sort of dragon mail. It has natural AC1, but it's 1/10 the weight of
plate mail. The natural intrinsic is just icing on the cake.

