The problem is that the RNG will keep trying to catch up with you
generating stronger and stronger foes as your XPs go up. It's also more
costly to get the free weightless AC.

It's a temporary strategy that can work very effectively for the 8 or
so levels of the game you need to manage. XL1 tames the RNG. It also 
gives your pet lots of food and XPs to gather. It gives you an oppotunity
to get the cash and AC needed to make the trip. And as soon as you get it
you can go into full wombat mode with the free weightless AC.

